    "SHO_Zaibatsu": "Bounty of the Rising Sun",
    "SHO_Zaibatsu_desc": "Shōnan's position as a satellite state of Japan has led to many things both politically and economically, but a prominent example of the latter is economic domination by the Japanese conglomerates known as Zaibatsu. The Zaibatsu' poor Malayan labourers work with inhumane conditions for long hours and little to no pay, effectively creating a system of slavery. Malaya has the potential to shine as brightly as the star of the Co-Prosperity Sphere, all we need is crush the rebellions once and for all.",
    "SHO_Dai-nijyugo": "Home of the 25th Army",
    "SHO_Dai-nijyugo_desc": "The 25th, the proud upholders of Shōnan!\nOn paper, at least.\nIn practice, the 25th is nothing but a shell of its former self, the 10 years of constant fighting back and forth with the rebels have whittled the once proud army into an undermanned, underfed and underequipped force. What keeps it going, is the supplies from Japan itself, and the weariness of their enemies. For good or bad, the 25th needs to win, as another loss will be final nail in its coffin.",
    "SHO_Dai-nijyugo_2": "Home of the 25th Army",
    "SHO_Dai-nijyugo_2_desc": "The 25th, the proud upholders of Shōnan!\nOn paper, at least.\nIn practice, the 25th is nothing but a shell of its former self, the 10 years of constant fighting back and forth with the rebels have whittled the once proud army into an undermanned, underfed and underequipped force. What keeps it going, is the supplies from Japan itself, and the weariness of their enemies. For good or bad, the 25th needs to win, as another loss will be final nail in its coffin.",
    "SHO_minority": "A Divided Collaboration Network",
    "SHO_minority_desc": "The long decade of conflict with the Malayan rebels left our network of allies, stretched thin as it started, even more radicalized, and torn apart. Informants we could trust turned as double agents, and individuals thought neutral at best turned into rebellion sympathizers. Not to say of our own “loyal” collaborators, transparent in their desire for personal power. Even so, it is what we have, and what Yamamoto will work with, for good or bad.",
    "SHO_Marai_Giyugun_Auxiliaries": "Marai Giyugun Auxiliaries",
    "SHO_Marai_Giyugun_Auxiliaries_desc": "Local militia, sympathizers to our regime and Pan-Asianism still exist through Malaya, fighting against the perverse rebels and their western masters. While, in an ideal situation, their work would be rewarded with a nod, and not much more of it, the 25th's decrepit state means whatever fully abled person able to take a gun and fight is more than welcome.",
    "SHO_Marai_Giyugun_Auxiliaries_2": "Marai Giyugun Auxiliaries",
    "SHO_Marai_Giyugun_Auxiliaries_2_desc": "Local militia, sympathizers to our regime and Pan-Asianism still exist through Malaya, fighting against the perverse rebels and their western masters. While, in an ideal situation, their work would be rewarded with a nod, and not much more of it, the 25th's decrepit state means whatever fully abled person able to take a gun and fight is more than welcome.",
